notes.content:
Hello everyone!
Update 1.05 is released. We apologize to everybody who encountered technical issues while playing RoboDo in multiplayer mode.

Now the game should be running smoothly, without any critical bugs.
Here are things that we done:
• Updated networking: co-op game should run way better;
• Updated player death and fixed multiple deaths while holding climbing wall;
• Performance update: improved loading time and fixed random frame drops;
• Fixed bug that drastically dropped fps after several deaths;
• Fixed moving platforms in CO-OP;
• Fixed climbing wall bug in CO-OP;
• Fixed randomly appearing black screen after restarting level;
• Fixed black screen after finishing tutorial levels;
• Updated battery and hands physics;
• other minor bugs.
Overall gameplay in singleplayer and CO-OP modes now are more fluid and more optimized. 

In the meantime we will continue to improve RoboDo game and create new content.
Currently we are working on:
• improving CO-OP aspect of the game;
• refining chapter 4 (it will be with a new puzzle element);
• will be adding invites and private sessions for CO-OP;
• sound FX.

 If you'll find any other issues and bugs please let us know. We will try to fix it as soon as possible! You are very welcome to join our Discord channel: https://discord.gg/cevJ3PY and report found bugs, share ideas or just simply chat.:)
We would be very grateful!
